url: "https://github.com/AnantGp/crossroad-fhir-link"
abstract: >-
  A synthetic Type 2 diabetes interoperability prototype combining federated
  terminology classification, FHIR terminology artifacts, and FHIR R4
  International Patient Summary document Bundles across four simulated sites.
  Includes a reproducible PyTorch FedAvg implementation, a React demonstration,
  and recorded evaluation and validator evidence for the HL7 AI Challenge 2026
  submission by Tech Adaptive Pandit.
keywords:
  - HL7
  - FHIR
  - International Patient Summary
  - federated learning
  - FedAvg
  - terminology mapping
  - semantic interoperability
  - Type 2 diabetes
  - synthetic data
